# The extrusion of path_extrude, its depth held and typed as 25 on its
# group screen; the same as path_extrude_depth.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/extrude_depth).
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
edit 25
